OL,3,GNEWSACouple in their 70s sentenced for
OL,4,Agrowing cannabis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA husband and wife in their 70s who had
OL,7,Fa cannabis-growing operation in their
OL,8,Fhome worth tens of thousands of pounds
OL,9,Fhave been sentenced.
OL,11,FPolice searched the home of Mark and
OL,12,FMarion Ayres in Burgh Common,
OL,13,FAttleborough, in May 2025.
OL,15,FOfficers said they found 25 cannabis
OL,16,Fplants and about 5.7kg of dry cannabis
OL,17,Fwith an estimated street value of more
OL,18,Fthan #46,000.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
