OL,3,GNEWSACouple in their 70s sentenced for
OL,4,Agrowing cannabis
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Norwich Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,7,FMark Ayres, 71, was given
OL,8,Fthree-and-a-half years in prison while
OL,9,Fhis 70-year-old wife was sentenced to
OL,10,Fnine months, suspended for 12 months.
